{"kind": "irc_in", "at": 1792808986.572087, "line": "PRIVMSG ant :What's new:"}
{"kind": "irc_in", "at": 1792808986.874329, "line": "PRIVMSG ant :Clover C1.5.9 (v1.5.9):"}
{"kind": "irc_in", "at": 1792808987.174651, "line": "PRIVMSG ant :\u2022 Helpers now start when your chat is not inside a code project, instead of being refused after a restart."}
{"kind": "irc_in", "at": 1792808987.4768362, "line": "PRIVMSG ant :\u2022 Helpers working in a real code project still get their own safe copy, and still stop if that copy cannot be m\u2026"}
{"kind": "irc_in", "at": 1792808987.778986, "line": "PRIVMSG ant :\u2022 When a helper is refused, the message now names the exact setting to change."}
{"kind": "irc_in", "at": 1792808988.079461, "line": "PRIVMSG ant :\u2022 The two helper isolation settings are now known, so changing them no longer shows a warning."}
{"kind": "irc_in", "at": 1792808988.3815832, "line": "PRIVMSG ant :\u2022 Identified 1.5.6 gateways no longer stop an update just because their reply-delivery code is older."}
{"kind": "irc_in", "at": 1792808988.6864152, "line": "PRIVMSG ant :\u2022 Updates keep restart work pending if ownership or a quiet restart cannot be verified; one reply may repeat."}
{"kind": "irc_in", "at": 1792808988.990758, "line": "PRIVMSG ant :\u2026and 10 more"}
